<!--pages/order/review.wxml-->
<!-- 骨架屏：加载订单详情期间展示，避免白屏 -->
<view class="sk-page" wx:if="{{loadState === 'loading'}}">
  <view class="sk-block skeleton-block sk-tip"></view>
  <view class="sk-block skeleton-block sk-card" wx:for="{{[1, 2]}}" wx:key="*this"></view>
</view>

<!-- 可评价态 -->
<block wx:if="{{loadState === 'ready'}}">
  <!-- 顶部信息条：订单号 + 积分提示 -->
  <view class="tip-bar">
    <text class="tip-no">订单号：{{orderNo}}</text>
    <text class="tip-point">评价得积分</text>
  </view>

  <!-- 每个商品一个评价块 -->
  <view class="review-block" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="goodsId" wx:for-index="idx" wx:for-item="item">
    <!-- 商品信息（只读） -->
    <view class="goods-row hairline-bottom">
      <view class="goods-pic">
        <image src="{{item.mainPic}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="handleGoodsImageError" data-item-index="{{idx}}" />
      </view>
      <view class="goods-meta flex-1">
        <view class="goods-name ellipsis-2">{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="goods-spec">{{item.specText}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 星级评分 -->
    <view class="rate-row">
      <view class="stars">
        <text
          class="star {{star <= item.rating ? 'star-on' : 'star-off'}}"
          wx:for="{{stars}}"
          wx:for-item="star"
          wx:for-index="si"
          wx:key="*this"
          data-item-index="{{idx}}"
          data-star="{{star}}"
          bindtap="handleStarTap"
        >{{star <= item.rating ? '★' : '☆'}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="rate-text">{{item.ratingText}}</text>
    </view>

    <!-- 快捷标签多选 -->
    <view class="tags">
      <view
        class="tag-item {{tag.selected ? 'tag-item-on' : ''}}"
        wx:for="{{item.tags}}"
        wx:for-item="tag"
        wx:for-index="ti"
        wx:key="label"
        data-item-index="{{idx}}"
        data-tag-index="{{ti}}"
        bindtap="handleTagTap"
      >{{tag.label}}</view>
    </view>

    <!-- 文字评价 -->
    <view class="content-wrap">
      <textarea
        class="content-input"
        maxlength="100"
        placeholder="说说这次购物的感受吧，可以帮助更多人哦~"
        placeholder-class="content-placeholder"
        data-item-index="{{idx}}"
        bindinput="handleContentInput"
      />
      <view class="content-counter">已输入 {{item.contentLength}}/100</view>
    </view>

    <!-- 晒图上传 -->
    <view class="img-grid">
      <view class="img-cell" wx:for="{{item.images}}" wx:for-item="img" wx:for-index="ii" wx:key="key">
        <image src="{{img.url}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="handleReviewImageError" data-item-index="{{idx}}" data-img-index="{{ii}}" />
        <view class="img-loading" wx:if="{{img.uploading}}">
          <view class="spinner"></view>
          <text>上传中</text>
        </view>
        <view class="img-del" catchtap="handleRemoveImage" data-item-index="{{idx}}" data-img-index="{{ii}}">×</view>
      </view>
      <view class="img-add" wx:if="{{item.images.length < 6}}" bindtap="handleChooseImage" data-item-index="{{idx}}">
        <text class="img-add-plus">+</text>
        <text class="img-add-num">{{item.images.length}}/6</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="submit-placeholder"></view>
  <view class="submit-bar safe-area-bottom">
    <view class="submit-btn {{submitting ? 'submit-btn-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="handleSubmit">发表评价</view>
  </view>
</block>

<!-- 订单不存在 / 加载失败 -->
<view class="empty" wx:if="{{loadState === 'empty'}}">
  <view class="empty-icon">📝</view>
  <view class="empty-text">订单不存在或已失效</view>
  <view class="empty-btn btn-primary" bindtap="handleBack">返回</view>
</view>

<!-- 已评价 -->
<view class="empty" wx:if="{{loadState === 'reviewed'}}">
  <view class="empty-icon">✅</view>
  <view class="empty-text">该订单已评价</view>
  <view class="empty-text">感谢你的支持~</view>
  <view class="empty-btn btn-primary" bindtap="handleBack">返回</view>
</view>
